<title>RUSSIA: Belarus GDP rises 1.0 pct in Jan-Sept year-on-year.</title>
<headline>Belarus GDP rises 1.0 pct in Jan-Sept year-on-year.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belarus gross domestic product in the first nine months of this year totalled 125.864 trillion Belarussian roubles, which was one percent more than a year earlier in inflation-adjusted terms, the State Statistics Committee said on Thursday.</p>
<p>GDP in September was 5.0 percent higher than a year earlier.</p>
<p>    BELARUS GDP			  SEP 96    AUG 96    SEP 95</p>
<p>    month-on-month pct change	+0.3	+2.8	-7.0</p>
<p>    year-on-year pct change	  +5.0	+1.0	-8.0</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
